  "job_B9.5.2_20251003_115017": {
    "chunk_text": "mede to Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: for\u00feon \u00fee nu genoh gecoplicu wise hi sylfe gegearwode & gecy\u00f0de, me lyste\u00fe acsian, Ac hw\u00e6t cwy\u00f0st \u00feu? Hwe\u00feer se acenneda Godes sunu, se is efnece \u00feam f\u00e6\u00f0er & \u00feam halgan gaste, on \u00feissere wisan Gregorius him andswarode: ure alysend \u00feurh his \u00feone m\u00e6nniscan lichaman eall \u00fe\u00e6t he dyde, he Witodlice se h\u00e6lend worhte \u00fe\u00e6t wundor, & he het hit helan, & swa \u00feeh hit forholen beon ne On \u00fean we magon cu\u00f0lice ongytan, \u00fe\u00e6t his gecorenan fylgea\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re bysene his lara in \u00feam & heora wylla by\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t hi syn forholene; ac \u00feeh \u00fe\u00e6t hi nytte syn o\u00f0rum mannum, hi beo\u00f0 full oft & \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00f0 mycelre eadmodnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t hi wilnia\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t heora weorc syn forholene, & eac mycelre Nis hit na \u00fe\u00e6t, Petrus, \u00fe\u00e6t drihten wolde aht swylces beon & ne mihte beon, ac he sealde \u00fea Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: me lica\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu sagast. Gregorius him andswarode: nu gyt hwylcehugu wisan w\u00e6ron to lafe, \u00fea we willa\u00fe sprecan be Hit gelamp on sume tid, \u00fe\u00e6t to geneal\u00e6hte se gebyrdd\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan Procules mynstres. On \u00fe\u00e6re stowe wunode swy\u00fee \u00e6\u00feel wer, \u00feam w\u00e6s nama Furtunatus. Se mid micclum benum b\u00e6d \u00feone arwur\u00f0an wer Bonefacium, \u00fea \u00fea he gedyde his m\u00e6ssan \u00dea ne mihte he for",
